From: Local build fix <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] PCI/bwctrl: Export pcie_set_target_speed() for modules

The NVMe speed switch patch (3006) calls pcie_set_target_speed() from
nvme-core, which is built as a module. Export the symbol so modpost
does not fail with an undefined symbol.

---
--- a/drivers/pci/pcie/bwctrl.c
+++ b/drivers/pci/pcie/bwctrl.c
@@ -156,6 +156,7 @@
 
 	return ret;
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(pcie_set_target_speed);
 
 static void pcie_bwnotif_enable(struct pcie_device *srv)
 {
